<diagram id="tace-approved-problem" name="05 - Approved Problem and Evidence"><mxGraphModel dx="1850" dy="1550" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1840" pageHeight="1620" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="phead" value="GATE 01 / APPROVED EDUCATION PROBLEM — EVIDENCE, RISKS AND GOAL ARCHITECTURE" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#202a48;strokeColor=#202a48;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=25;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/decisions/ADR-0003-education-problem-statement-approval.md"><mxGeometry x="40" y="35" width="1740" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pformal" value="APPROVED FORMAL PROBLEM
Educators and training providers must assess learning, identify difficulties, adapt materials, coordinate support and manage communication under time and resource pressure. When the work crosses documents, systems and people, turning evidence into useful action becomes difficult and time-consuming." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#321650;strokeColor=#6d4a89;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;spacing=17;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/decisions/ADR-0003-education-problem-statement-approval.md"><mxGeometry x="40" y="150" width="860" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="psimple" value="APPROVED SIMPLE VERSION
A teacher may know learners need help but still has assessments, lessons and reports to finish. A learner may need different support, yet the right material or intervention does not always arrive when needed. The problem is turning information into action." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1ecfa;strokeColor=#97adce;fontColor=#1b3150;fontSize=17;spacing=17;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/decisions/ADR-0003-education-problem-statement-approval.md"><mxGeometry x="930" y="150" width="850" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="psrc0" value="01  WORKLOAD — OECD TALIS 2024
72% report excessive marking as stress; 66% excessive administration; 7.1 h/week marking, 4.9 h/week admin (full-time teacher reports)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f5fb;strokeColor=#bbcadf;fontColor=#1b3150;fontSize=15;spacing=14;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-STATEMENT.md"><mxGeometry x="40" y="435" width="420" height="195" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="psrc1" value="02  LEARNING GAPS — TIMSS 2023
55% of assessed Grade 9 learners below the lowest international Mathematics benchmark; not a school exam fail rate" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f5fb;strokeColor=#bbcadf;fontColor=#1b3150;fontSize=15;spacing=14;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-STATEMENT.md"><mxGeometry x="485" y="435" width="420" height="195" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="psrc2" value="03  LANGUAGE ACCESS — DBE 2026/27
Bilingual mother-tongue support in Mathematics, Science and Technology alongside English is a policy priority" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f5fb;strokeColor=#bbcadf;fontColor=#1b3150;fontSize=15;spacing=14;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-STATEMENT.md"><mxGeometry x="930" y="435" width="420" height="195" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="psrc3" value="04  INTEROPERABILITY — OECD 2023
Tools that do not exchange data lead to duplicate input, manual reconciliation and harder timely decisions. General evidence, not academy-specific." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f5fb;strokeColor=#bbcadf;fontColor=#1b3150;fontSize=15;spacing=14;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-STATEMENT.md"><mxGeometry x="1375" y="435" width="420" height="195" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="priskhead" value="POTENTIAL CONSEQUENCES IF THE PROBLEM PERSISTS — INFERENCES, NOT ESTABLISHED CAUSAL EFFECTS" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#202a48;strokeColor=#202a48;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=25;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-STATEMENT.md"><mxGeometry x="40" y="678" width="1740" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prisk0" value="1. Staff time diverted from individual teaching and feedback" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2e6;strokeColor=#d8ae82;fontColor=#6d4421;fontSize=16;spacing=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-STATEMENT.md"><mxGeometry x="40" y="785" width="558" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prisk1" value="2. Delayed help while learners continue to struggle" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2e6;strokeColor=#d8ae82;fontColor=#6d4421;fontSize=16;spacing=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-STATEMENT.md"><mxGeometry x="635" y="785" width="558" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prisk2" value="3. Language barriers leave some materials less accessible" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2e6;strokeColor=#d8ae82;fontColor=#6d4421;fontSize=16;spacing=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-STATEMENT.md"><mxGeometry x="1230" y="785" width="558" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prisk3" value="4. Repeated data entry and reconciliation errors" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2e6;strokeColor=#d8ae82;fontColor=#6d4421;fontSize=16;spacing=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-STATEMENT.md"><mxGeometry x="40" y="927" width="558" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prisk4" value="5. Resource clashes, missed sessions or deadlines" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2e6;strokeColor=#d8ae82;fontColor=#6d4421;fontSize=16;spacing=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-STATEMENT.md"><mxGeometry x="635" y="927" width="558" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prisk5" value="6. Incorrect unverified content reduces output trust" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2e6;strokeColor=#d8ae82;fontColor=#6d4421;fontSize=16;spacing=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-STATEMENT.md"><mxGeometry x="1230" y="927" width="558" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pproblem" value="RESEARCH-BASED PROBLEM: workload + learning gaps + language access + interoperability" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#321650;strokeColor=#6d4a89;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;spacing=17;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-STATEMENT.md"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1135" width="825" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="phypothesis" value="PROPOSED SOLUTION, NOT YET PROVEN: universal goal-to-execution engine chooses proportionate agents/tools, authorizations, checks and verified outputs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f7ee;strokeColor=#91bea6;fontColor=#23573c;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;spacing=14;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-ARCHITECTURE.md"><mxGeometry x="930" y="1135" width="850" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="plink" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#9796aa;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pproblem" target="phypothesis"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmetrics" value="TEST THE HYPOTHESIS: verified time-to-outcome; correctness; citations; accessible-material review; schedule constraints; actual saved files/API receipts; required human sign-off; costs. NO measured benefit claimed." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbfafc;strokeColor=#beb8c8;fontColor=#465068;fontSize=15;spacing=15;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/gates/GATE-01-PROBLEM-ARCHITECTURE.md"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1335" width="1740" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pfooter" value="ADR-0003 freezes formal + simple + pitch wording. Detailed G01 remains IN_RESEARCH; G02 BLOCKED. Figma FigJam board: https://www.figma.com/board/WObVafIxNSBwRssWhTk5wi" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbfafc;strokeColor=#beb8c8;fontColor=#465068;fontSize=15;spacing=15;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" link="https://github.com/LethaboMH14/T.A.C.E/blob/main/docs/decisions/ADR-0003-education-problem-statement-approval.md"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1480" width="1740" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
</mxfile>